{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：21:00 2026-09-25 HKT</p>\n\n<p>「聲夢小花」姚焯菲（Chantel）日前迎來20歲生日，正式告別青澀歲月，邁入「二字頭」大個女階段。姚焯菲目前正在美國紐約留學，她在社交平台晒出多張慶生靚相。相中可見，向來走清純甜美路線的姚焯菲，今次破格大解放，換上一襲粉紅色低胸吊帶連身裙，置身於浪漫的高級餐廳內捧生日蛋糕拍照，舉手投足散發前所未見的輕熟女人味。而在另一套造型中，她身穿淺藍色露肩抹胸裙，對住生日蛋糕吹蠟燭，在火光映照下性感中不失少女味，讓粉絲驚喜萬分充滿遐想。</p>\n<h2>圈中好友向姚焯菲隔空祝福</h2>\n<p>姚焯菲在帖文中以英文寫道：「let the twenties begin &amp; bloom（讓20歲開始並綻放）」，高調宣告人生翻開全新一頁。這輯極具女人味的慶生美照曝光後，隨即引來大批網民及圈中好友瘋狂洗版送上祝福，紛紛驚嘆昔日的「國民初戀」真的長大了，大讚她「越大越靚」、「大個女完美蛻變」，而《聲夢傳奇》昔日戰友炎明熹亦第一時間現身留言：「Happy happy birthday telllllllllll」，而在《愛回家》有份合作的呂慧儀，亦隔空送上真摯祝賀。</p>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲去年與李立仁開學僅半個月已成為好友！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ff6f3f027d4ff9e7d8c261fd309f757/2025-09/chantelyiu_1748781715_3645367700303869856_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲與李克勤的大仔李立仁（Ryan）被網民發現私下互動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b180e186342feedb4a39629fa170ec7/2025-09/chantelyiu_1754659699_3694675800579707687_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲（Chantel）遠赴美國紐約大學藝術學院升學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca7201a9c765c91641b127fee1230b2a/2025-09/chantelyiu_1756474850_3709902393434002285_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲早前於香港圓滿舉行首個個人演唱會，隨後立即返美開學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0ab21723044be7caa5c8ca5321a347c6/2026-09/Screenshot_20260731-220116_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲換上粉紅低胸吊帶裙，在浪漫燭光下展現輕熟性感美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6d5495a75e189d413af2c9a4753cb26/2026-09/SaveClip_App_821405141_18462260953185303_4792332693143716258_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲雙手捧起精緻花卉蛋糕，慶生儀式感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0114a36a17b892ebf7a72860e23372ca/2026-09/SaveClip_App_821638183_18462260941185303_7554110762537805661_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲踏入20歲，身材相當有睇頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18cfeb149dfd575a4f9508683ef93a65/2026-09/SaveClip_App_822413222_18462260926185303_3694285599338672083_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲走下樓梯優雅回眸，大騷白滑香肩與迷人身段。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7161066757a54b81ca71c4d9948d3d79/2026-09/SaveClip_App_823587697_18462260944185303_1110467226890016902_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲身穿淺藍色抹胸裙，對著鮮花大蛋糕甜笑許願。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad0fc453cbcd745bd8c27f21167e4b51/2026-09/20__1__chantelyiu__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲於樓梯間留影，微露酥胸散發女人味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85bf7cef39026cb40977ba0c9981691d/2026-09/20__2__chantelyiu__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲專注凝望燭光，迎接人生全新階段。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a043423460a3bbbbdcfd14d3273d806/2026-09/20__3__chantelyiu__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲嘟嘴吹熄生日蠟燭，性感中不失少女甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c28af6f911f54999a0a3521993e7182/2026-09/20__5__chantelyiu__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲穿上深灰大V領上衣漫步紐約街頭，低胸露腰微露性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24f15050983f1cb81b80c3d9710e13a1/2026-09/SaveClip_App_800115162_18459357190185303_9021208440618600042_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲手持飲品街拍，展現滿滿留學生的隨性美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b559e22b83561d725e88927e50fd266c/2026-09/SaveClip_App_800482761_18459357133185303_540773797827905880_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲大方公開宿舍「亂糟糟」的梳化，上面堆滿公仔與雜物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27f69b953da5978b83196f13b3f5d100/2026-09/SaveClip_App_800540278_18459357211185303_8561430671656567513_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲上載車內超近鏡自拍，淡妝上陣皮膚狀態極佳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fe87bc54922dd55d98606671e6733c9/2026-09/SaveClip_App_800617153_18459357244185303_2968346795869809115_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鏡頭下的姚焯菲神采飛揚，散發輕熟少女魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7afe172b618d58218956957c2558cd6/2026-09/SaveClip_App_800780655_18459357229185303_5759008018554235962_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲坐在共享單車上留影，大晒纖細小蠻腰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00ab616998e55c0a39f5a373cb014102/2026-09/SaveClip_App_800924886_18459357151185303_3909157627538085786_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲在唐人街，四處蹓躂拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/711918b9e60be0a7151a3832f7cda4e5/2026-02/2_23_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲跟朋友開大食會，襯衣下身材非常澎湃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dee481c25e9c78ae9fb7bc04edb36d40/2026-02/3_23_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲拖實李克勤長子李立仁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83a0d64a6c1680a9bb8626715b7cfd29/2025-11/1_11_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李立仁難掩笑意，面上亦有點怕醜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52f78f5e31015998c2e4abfc75f056b0/2025-11/68_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲嘟起小嘴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4158ca1c2e2b0092302433a69a83e10/2025-11/69_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲李立仁公開耍花槍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/261905eef493bd77d421996d8c2e6928/2025-11/70_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲李立仁可謂金童玉女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a06c80bb7d7043d106965b47d2a5266/2025-11/71_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲喜愛美食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57b2f64affc5c1bfa4b9a48763d5b0f7/2025-10/3_0_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲掛住香港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f197a5a0ee3d1fc647f5e0960cc7e6a6/2025-10/4_0_26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲在紐約街頭為她的新節目《廣東話估歌仔》揭開序幕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b217601f4d619ebe94dd003faadb3e6/2025-10/4_1_1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲興奮地宣布要在紐約挑戰「估歌仔」遊戲，將廣東歌帶到世界舞台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5d9c853d4476482a6afcf9a9a7297f0/2025-10/5_1_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲邀請不同文化背景的同學仔一齊玩遊戲，推廣廣東歌文化。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47043468cde30c7b1d696df02b07f64e/2025-10/6_1_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<h2>姚焯菲現於紐約攻讀音樂商業</h2>\n<p>姚焯菲去年隻身遠赴美國，入讀知名學府紐約大學攻讀為期四年的音樂商業學士課程。雖然長駐海外專注學業，但她從未停下演藝步伐，每逢學校假期便馬不停蹄返港接工作、推出新歌兼與粉絲聚會。早前她趁暑假回港，圓滿舉行了入行5年來首個個人演唱會《想飛Live Concert 2026》，成功兼顧學業與歌唱事業。</p>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲入行4年，未有荒廢學業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c8297ab4b94611eb29aad4d5f99bede/2025-08/Chantel_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲在2023年初低調出發去紐西蘭讀書。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/969b58d9cfb2d077681199f3aa26d837/2023-01/319924509_2468850516587603_5684158531235220550_n.mp4_snapshot_00.01.853.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲間中在IG表達思鄉之情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73fdedb581854695e334088b13ae9d37/2024-07/chantelyiu_1716706551_3376301726268801781_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲為工作不時往返香港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a0c04e274c983458370b77915d94f41/2025-08/Chantel_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲早前中學畢業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0bf3abc5ea8b63e990ec894e793451dd/2024-12/WhatsApp_Image_2024-12-09_at_1_25_21_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt='姚焯菲獲學校頒發學術獎項\"Academic High Distinction\"，相當厲害。' src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbd578508f3e42bbdec4b9cbe868f7ee/2024-12/WhatsApp_Image_2024-12-09_at_4_46_19_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲考獲車牌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4ba73df657b87f901e9785283e16162/2024-12/WhatsApp_Image_2024-12-09_at_1_25_22_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲在紐西蘭已開始學揸車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16088e6d180424285e725f83ea839748/2024-02/almost_half_way_through.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲早前飛往美國紐約展開大學留學生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8f177c7c70035b15d679decca125e3b/2025-09/chantelyiu_1756821023_3712806306580410096_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"到埗兩星期的她，特意拍片向粉絲分享近況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6f6198702eda9268c1e8e45004dc26a/2025-09/chantelyiu_1756821023_3712806306748182572_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲親述紐約治安狀況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6852aa73be71108a3c095016a5b3213d/2025-09/chantelyiu_1757772885_3720789927551489369_5733913302_mp4_snapshot_00_40_000.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲留學美國思鄉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0df619831a8bfcac20ee15ce87bd2eb/2025-09/chantelyiu_1757772885_3720789927551489369_5733913302_mp4_snapshot_00_50_000.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲在影片中提到，最多人問的問題就是「紐約究竟安唔安全？」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a6ecdf60b4e3449ebe50a80cc3e7c58/2025-09/chantelyiu_1757772885_3720789927551489369_5733913302_mp4_snapshot_00_57_055.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲指雖然紐約街頭好多流浪漢、醉酒人士，但比她想像中安全。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d5ce9d1883fa5685e679efc92f3a8bf/2025-09/chantelyiu_1757772885_3720789927551489369_5733913302_mp4_snapshot_01_05_278.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲補充，自己暫時從未遇過偷竊或槍擊案等問題，請粉絲們不用過於擔心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ef22fb7eea7e90caf329f20dcc4d039/2025-09/VS--Instagram-0_00__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲早前已畢業回港，在新城頒獎禮勇奪「勁爆躍進女歌手」金獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9583444682536a5fe8af970b09cf4a2b/2025-01/chantelyiu_1735563653_3534486558835589288_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲現身「小菲象」為她舉行的補祝生日會及多個商場騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/149e6a1d11f416ffd5cd11ed484fc5b0/2025-01/chantelyiu_1734624250_3526606275977287191_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲表示渴望到美國升讀大學，不過如果香港三大大學給予Offer，也會考慮留港升學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e8c721d31e1bcbe455cc9da93780bd8/2025-01/10eb075a-6203-4b8b-8bd7-4b27995fcaec.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲對「Entertainment Business and Management」這科感興趣，惜該學科為碩士學位，又指若大學讀書不太辛苦的話，會想再修讀項士學位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/972f26f30ee204f61e923ab98705a193/2025-01/chantelyiu_1735824340_3536673357884455535_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"為了方便工作，香港的大學也是姚焯菲考慮之列。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb6f048b5ac4f0c0a291bd47df0fd3ab/2025-01/chantelyiu_1734624250_3526606275792629100_5733913302.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲參加《聲夢》時只有14歲。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fb8dfbd192f5122f02c2b601d59724b/2023-06/26_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲是第一季《聲夢傳奇》亞軍，憑翻唱《戀愛預告》大受歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b43ab9b4e4cbb7f6a577f982143e4d49/2023-01/004_21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"（左起）鍾柔美14歲參加《聲夢傳奇》時，與年紀相若的姚焯菲與詹天文穿上校服唱《到此為止》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ed84e78350c7bfb352097d007bff3e0/2023-11/Qwrk3iNK_7XU9vy3_CS4WTIxj3rj9Eiiwq_DLsKvwy4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"炎明熹與姚焯菲穿上校服拍劇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5db4d53fd944a45d45b99b07f17aae2e/2023-11/909_600.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲曾為宣道國際學校的學生。（學校官網影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a38078f290e88bffecedd2a49abe12fc/2023-11/20211216141004_1_0-16-screenshot.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當時姚焯菲有穿上校服。（學校官網影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8dd1614f24d96ec4d5ba863fa34ffd39/2023-11/20211216141011_5_0-26-screenshot.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚焯菲當時成為學校的風頭躉。（學校官網圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/239f7cb8b6725a5a1da040eb511d5cd2/2023-11/20211216141051_0_cloliv7zwalrb7-3yjzaajkpflzz-x22uhuwo1b7sds.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"聖誕假期完結，Chantel 已經返回紐約繼續專心讀書。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a223c13d74e8dc38415c6e1eb9684ae/2026-01/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-29_at_4_03_27_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Chantel與兩位女同學合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2bb77511014dee433a9d3dfb77b487c/2026-01/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-29_at_4_03_27_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Chante分享到紐約中央公園遊玩的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7077332020e859e143b4322b6c48f474/2026-01/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-29_at_4_03_28_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Chantel凍到鼻子及面頰通紅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cca9bff648af753e84b093ccc4d74fca/2026-01/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-29_at_4_03_28_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲紛紛留言叫她注意保暖：「保重身體，唔好冷親！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff9753c1f0b8ee7e9baf918756937c26/2026-01/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-29_at_4_03_28_PM.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T13:18:43.378566+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":652,"images":62,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}